{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春，陳侯使女叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"二、夏五月癸丑，衞侯朔卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"三、六月辛未朔，日有食之，鼓用牲于社。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"日食則曷為鼓用牲于社？求乎陰之道也，以朱絲營社，或曰脅之，或曰為闇，恐人犯之，故營之。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"四、伯姬歸于〈木巳〉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"五、秋，大水，鼓用牲于社于門。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"其言于社于門何？于社，禮也；于門，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_54_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_54","textTraditional":"六、冬，公子友如陳。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}